    "title": "Orland Park to spend $12 million on pool repairs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Vorva ,\n3 hours ago Since taking over as mayor last May, James Dodge has been concerned about how money is being spent on village amenities – specifically Centennial Park West. The mayor has renewed urgency to figure things out on the amenities front after the board approved $12 million in repairs for the pools at the fitness center and aquatic center. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
